e that.\r\nSo I'm definitely fine with reverting this one (and the 3D equivalent).","created_at":"2025-05-01T11:39:38Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T11:39:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105959#discussion_r2070177772","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105959","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2070177772"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105959#discussion_r2070177772"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105959"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2070177772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":2,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2069980078,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":3,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]